{"is_error":false,"duration_api_ms":66456,"num_turns":1,"stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"a4df4a4f-d5cc-4f06-96ba-0d488e514c1a","total_cost_usd":0.5030765,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":34998,"cache_read_input_tokens":20095,"output_tokens":4802,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":34998,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":4802,"cache_read_input_tokens":20095,"cache_creation_input_tokens":34998,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":34998},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":22899,"outputTokens":18,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.022989,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000,"canonicalModel":"claude-haiku-4-5","provider":"firstParty"},"claude-opus-5":{"inputTokens":2,"outputTokens":4802,"cacheReadInputTokens":20095,"cacheCreationInputTokens":34998,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.4800875,"contextWindow":1000000,"maxOutputTokens":64000,"canonicalModel":"claude-opus-5","provider":"firstParty"}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","fast_mode_disabled_reason":"sdk_opt_in_required","subtype":"success","api_error_status":null,"result":"{\"agent\":\"debris-designer\",\"size_classes\":{\"small\":{\"slots_crushed\":1,\"slots_uncrushed\":2,\"hand_tetherable\":true},\"medium\":{\"slots_crushed\":2,\"slots_uncrushed\":4,\"hand_tetherable\":true},\"oversized\":{\"slots_crushed\":6,\"slots_uncrushed\":12,\"hand_tetherable\":false}},\"debris\":[{\"id\":\"crumpled_hull_panel\",\"display_name\":\"Crumpled Hull Panel\",\"band\":\"suborbital\",\"size_class\":\"small\",\"fragile\":false,\"mass_kg\":9.0,\"spawn_weight\":22,\"notes\":\"A dented sheet of thin skin plating torn off something bigger; the bread-and-butter scrap of the low sky and the first thing most players ever tether.\"},{\"id\":\"bent_truss_section\",\"display_name\":\"Bent Truss Section\",\"band\":\"suborbital\",\"size_class\":\"medium\",\"fragile\":false,\"mass_kg\":31.0,\"spawn_weight\":16,\"notes\":\"A buckled length of lattice strut, awkward to swing around but solid enough to shrug off a rough landing.\"},{\"id\":\"insulation_blanket_wad\",\"display_name\":\"Insulation Blanket Wad\",\"band\":\"suborbital\",\"size_class\":\"small\",\"fragile\":false,\"mass_kg\":4.0,\"spawn_weight\":18,\"notes\":\"A balled-up wad of gold multilayer foil; almost weightless, so it is the piece to grab when the jetpack is nearly dry.\"},{\"id\":\"spent_kick_motor\",\"display_name\":\"Spent Kick Motor\",\"band\":\"suborbital\",\"size_class\":\"medium\",\"fragile\":false,\"mass_kg\":48.0,\"spawn_weight\":10,\"notes\":\"A burnt-out solid upper-stage motor casing, the heaviest thing in the low band and a real drag on the way home.\"},{\"id\":\"antenna_boom_stub\",\"display_name\":\"Antenna Boom Stub\",\"band\":\"suborbital\",\"size_class\":\"small\",\"fragile\":false,\"mass_kg\":6.5,\"spawn_weight\":14,\"notes\":\"A snapped-off length of boom tubing with the mount still attached; cheap, plentiful, and easy to string three at a time.\"},{\"id\":\"cracked_viewport_glass\",\"display_name\":\"Cracked Viewport Glass\",\"band\":\"suborbital\",\"size_class\":\"small\",\"fragile\":true,\"mass_kg\":7.0,\"spawn_weight\":8,\"notes\":\"A spidered pane of pressure glazing still in its frame; the player's first lesson that a glinting piece cannot be crushed and hates a hard touchdown.\"},{\"id\":\"battery_pallet\",\"display_name\":\"Battery Pallet\",\"band\":\"suborbital\",\"size_class\":\"medium\",\"fragile\":false,\"mass_kg\":40.0,\"spawn_weight\":9,\"notes\":\"A rack of swollen cells bolted to a carrier plate; dense for the band and a good early test of whether the hold or the chute gives out first.\"},{\"id\":\"dish_reflector_shard\",\"display_name\":\"Dish Reflector Shard\",\"band\":\"suborbital\",\"size_class\":\"medium\",\"fragile\":true,\"mass_kg\":13.0,\"spawn_weight\":5,\"notes\":\"A curved wedge of parabolic mesh that catches the sun on a slow cycle; light for its bulk, but it pays uncrushed slot cost forever.\"},{\"id\":\"scorched_fairing_half\",\"display_name\":\"Scorched Fairing Half\",\"band\":\"suborbital\",\"size_class\":\"oversized\",\"fragile\":false,\"mass_kg\":210.0,\"spawn_weight\":3,\"notes\":\"Half a payload shroud, big as a shed and crane-cable only — visible in the low sky all game as a promise of what the winch will one day reach. Unreachable in the shipping slice.\"},{\"id\":\"reaction_wheel_housing\",\"display_name\":\"Reaction Wheel Housing\",\"band\":\"low\",\"size_class\":\"small\",\"fragile\":false,\"mass_kg\":22.0,\"spawn_weight\":16,\"notes\":\"A sealed drum of gyro and bearing, small enough for one slot but startlingly dense in the hand.\"},{\"id\":\"cracked_solar_array\",\"display_name\":\"Cracked Solar Array\",\"band\":\"low\",\"size_class\":\"medium\",\"fragile\":true,\"mass_kg\":26.0,\"spawn_weight\":9,\"notes\":\"A hinged wing of cells with a fractured spar, glinting off the common clumps on its own faster orbit; the signature fragile piece of the slice.\"},{\"id\":\"propellant_tank_shell\",\"display_name\":\"Propellant Tank Shell\",\"band\":\"low\",\"size_class\":\"medium\",\"fragile\":false,\"mass_kg\":72.0,\"spawn_weight\":12,\"notes\":\"A ruptured titanium sphere, still smelling of hydrazine; the heaviest solid haul a mid-game hold can comfortably carry home.\"},{\"id\":\"avionics_crate\",\"display_name\":\"Avionics Crate\",\"band\":\"low\",\"size_class\":\"small\",\"fragile\":false,\"mass_kg\":18.0,\"spawn_weight\":14,\"notes\":\"A shielded box of flight computers wrenched free of its rack; compact, heavy for its size, and the low band's reliable filler.\"},{\"id\":\"star_tracker_head\",\"display_name\":\"Star Tracker Head\",\"band\":\"low\",\"size_class\":\"small\",\"fragile\":true,\"mass_kg\":11.0,\"spawn_weight\":7,\"notes\":\"A baffled optical head with its lens intact — tiny, delicate, and worth crossing a band-width of empty sky for if the touchdown can be kept soft.\"},{\"id\":\"radiator_panel\",\"display_name\":\"Radiator Panel\",\"band\":\"low\",\"size_class\":\"medium\",\"fragile\":false,\"mass_kg\":44.0,\"spawn_weight\":13,\"notes\":\"A finned slab of coolant plumbing; broad and slow to stop, so it swings wide on every turn of a loaded string.\"},{\"id\":\"docking_collar\",\"display_name\":\"Docking Collar\",\"band\":\"low\",\"size_class\":\"medium\",\"fragile\":false,\"mass_kg\":85.0,\"spawn_weight\":8,\"notes\":\"A machined ring of latches and seals, the densest thing in the low band and enough on its own to push a full hold past the soft-landing line.\"},{\"id\":\"gyro_platform_frame\",\"display_name\":\"Gyro Platform Frame\",\"band\":\"low\",\"size_class\":\"medium\",\"fragile\":false,\"mass_kg\":58.0,\"spawn_weight\":10,\"notes\":\"A cast frame with three wheels still mounted; solid, forgiving, and the piece that teaches how a medium tows against a small.\"},{\"id\":\"antenna_feed_horn\",\"display_name\":\"Antenna Feed Horn\",\"band\":\"low\",\"size_class\":\"small\",\"fragile\":true,\"mass_kg\":9.5,\"spawn_weight\":6,\"notes\":\"A flared waveguide horn with its window unbroken; light enough that latch jerk is survivable, which makes it the fragile piece players learn technique on.\"},{\"id\":\"ruptured_pressure_vessel\",\"display_name\":\"Ruptured Pressure Vessel\",\"band\":\"low\",\"size_class\":\"oversized\",\"fragile\":false,\"mass_kg\":340.0,\"spawn_weight\":2,\"notes\":\"A split-open habitat tank the size of a bus; crane-cable only and out of reach until the winch ships. Unreachable in the shipping slice.\"},{\"id\":\"instrument_bus_core\",\"display_name\":\"Instrument Bus Core\",\"band\":\"high\",\"size_class\":\"medium\",\"fragile\":false,\"mass_kg\":130.0,\"spawn_weight\":13,\"notes\":\"The structural heart of a dead satellite, packed with harness and shielding; the high band's staple and roughly three low-band pieces of mass in one slot pair.\"},{\"id\":\"plutonium_cask_shell\",\"display_name\":\"Plutonium Cask Shell\",\"band\":\"high\",\"size_class\":\"small\",\"fragile\":false,\"mass_kg\":96.0,\"spawn_weight\":10,\"notes\":\"An empty isotope-generator cask of layered tungsten; one crushed slot and nearly a hundred kilos, the purest expression of high-band density.\"},{\"id\":\"solar_wing_assembly\",\"display_name\":\"Solar Wing Assembly\",\"band\":\"high\",\"size_class\":\"medium\",\"fragile\":true,\"mass_kg\":78.0,\"spawn_weight\":11,\"notes\":\"A full unfolded array wing, acres of cell and hinge; it glints from half a screen away and cannot be crushed at any tier.\"},{\"id\":\"cryo_optics_barrel\",\"display_name\":\"Cryo Optics Barrel\",\"band\":\"high\",\"size_class\":\"medium\",\"fragile\":true,\"mass_kg\":64.0,\"spawn_weight\":9,\"notes\":\"A telescope barrel with its cold mirror still seated, orbiting well off the clumps at real relative speed; a patient approach or a torn-off magnet.\"},{\"id\":\"ion_thruster_grid\",\"display_name\":\"Ion Thruster Grid\",\"band\":\"high\",\"size_class\":\"small\",\"fragile\":true,\"mass_kg\":21.0,\"spawn_weight\":7,\"notes\":\"A stack of etched molybdenum accelerator grids, thin as paper and priceless intact; the cheapest fragile gamble in the top band.\"},{\"id\":\"momentum_wheel_cluster\",\"display_name\":\"Momentum Wheel Cluster\",\"band\":\"high\",\"size_class\":\"medium\",\"fragile\":false,\"mass_kg\":150.0,\"spawn_weight\":9,\"notes\":\"Four wheels on a common casting, still spinning slowly; heavy enough that a pair of them rewrites the descent plan.\"},{\"id\":\"apogee_engine_bell\",\"display_name\":\"Apogee Engine Bell\",\"band\":\"high\",\"size_class\":\"medium\",\"fragile\":false,\"mass_kg\":112.0,\"spawn_weight\":11,\"notes\":\"A niobium expansion nozzle, scorched blue at the throat; solid, dense, and the safe pick when the hold is already fragile-heavy.\"},{\"id\":\"atomic_clock_package\",\"display_name\":\"Atomic Clock Package\",\"band\":\"high\",\"size_class\":\"small\",\"fragile\":true,\"mass_kg\":33.0,\"spawn_weight\":6,\"notes\":\"A vacuum-sealed maser package on vibration mounts; small, glinting, and the single most demanding hand-tether in the game.\"},{\"id\":\"antenna_mesh_reflector\",\"display_name\":\"Antenna Mesh Reflector\",\"band\":\"high\",\"size_class\":\"medium\",\"fragile\":true,\"mass_kg\":47.0,\"spawn_weight\":8,\"notes\":\"A furled gold-mesh dish on a deployable rib frame; bulky, uncrushable, and it fills a hold faster than its mass suggests.\"},{\"id\":\"transponder_farm_rack\",\"display_name\":\"Transponder Farm Rack\",\"band\":\"high\",\"size_class\":\"medium\",\"fragile\":false,\"mass_kg\":124.0,\"spawn_weight\":10,\"notes\":\"A whole communications payload rack sheared from its bus; unglamorous, enormously heavy, and the backbone of a profitable top-band run.\"},{\"id\":\"upper_stage_skirt\",\"display_name\":\"Upper Stage Skirt\",\"band\":\"high\",\"size_class\":\"oversized\",\"fragile\":false,\"mass_kg\":520.0,\"spawn_weight\":2,\"notes\":\"An interstage skirt with the separation ring still bolted on — crane-cable only, and the practice run for Mr. Armstrong's satellite above it. Unreachable in the shipping slice.\"}],\"band_summary\":[{\"band\":\"suborbital\",\"piece_count\":9,\"fragile_fraction\":0.1238,\"mean_mass_kg\":36.5},{\"band\":\"low\",\"piece_count\":10,\"fragile_fraction\":0.2062,\"mean_mass_kg\":68.55},{\"band\":\"high\",\"piece_count\":11,\"fragile_fraction\":0.4038,\"mean_mass_kg\":98.64}],\"design_notes\":[\"Mean mass climbs 36.5 -> 68.6 -> 98.6 kg across the bands, a 2.7x spread suborbital to high, but the oversized pieces distort that: excluding the crane-only pieces the hand-tetherable means are 14.9 -> 38.4 -> 86.5 kg, a 5.8x climb. That is the GDD's central bet made arithmetic — a full hold of high-band junk is roughly six times the mass of the same hold filled suborbital, which raises ballistic coefficient, lengthens the time spent above heating-onset speed, and pushes chute touchdown speed up by sqrt(m) exactly as 2.3.2 requires.\",\"Fragile spawn weight runs 0.124 -> 0.206 -> 0.404 of each band's total weight. Suborbital sits just above the GDD's 1-in-10 because two fragile types are needed there to teach both halves of the rule (uncrushable bulk via the dish shard, and double landing damage via the viewport glass). The high band overshoots 1-in-4 deliberately: five of its eleven pieces are fragile because 2.3.7 says the top band skews fragile and because fragility is the one reward upgrades cannot buy, so it is what keeps the endgame tied to flying skill. If the Economy Balancer finds the top band's payout ceiling too skill-gated, the cheapest lever is dropping ion_thruster_grid and atomic_clock_package weights, not re-authoring pieces.\",\"Every size class and the fragile flag appear inside the shipping slice. Suborbital and low together carry five small, six medium and four fragile hand-tetherable types, so a player who never sees the high band still meets the compactor rule, the uncrushable exception, and the tether-slot squeeze.\",\"Density is decoupled from bulk on purpose so no piece is strictly best. The plutonium cask shell is one crushed slot for 96 kg — slot-efficient and descent-punishing; the antenna mesh reflector is 47 kg that can never be crushed — mass-cheap and hold-hungry. A player optimising for slots and a player optimising for reentry mass reach for different pieces from the same debris field.\",\"Oversized is held to one piece per band, all three marked unreachable in the semester slice. Their masses (210 / 340 / 520 kg) are set so each is roughly a quarter to half of a loaded ship on its own, which makes the upper_stage_skirt an honest rehearsal for the satellite that sits above the top band.\"]}","ttft_ms":64452,"ttft_stream_ms":1962,"time_to_request_ms":231,"type":"result","duration_ms":64560,"uuid":"f5acb7c8-a109-4baf-bc6f-05b0a7388988"}
